    <DataNode elementId="AT2G42790-MONOMER" textLabel="Citrate synthase 3, peroxisomal" type="Protein">
      <Xref identifier="Q9SJH7" dataSource="uniprot" />
      <Graphics centerX="1650" centerY="995" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="000000" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="000000" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="pmngroup">Based on its peroxisomal localization and the phenotype of mutant plants, this protein is believed to function in fatty acid oxidation and not in the TCA cycle or glyoxylate metabolism |CITS: [15923350]|.</Comment>
